      "text": "次第: as soon as; if 〜, then immediately 〜.\nThis grammar implies a planned sequence of actions. It does NOT imply a surprising result. As a result, this grammar cannot be used with the past tense.\n\nＶ(ます form MINUS ます) + 次第\n\n次第で(は) or 次第だ: depends on; is decided by; changes depending on.\n\nＮ + 次第だ・次第で(は)",
      "html": "次第: as soon as; if 〜, then immediately 〜.<br/>This grammar implies a planned sequence of actions. It does NOT imply a surprising result. As a result, this grammar cannot be used with the past tense.<br/><br/>Ｖ(ます form MINUS ます) + 次第<br/><br/>次第で(は) or 次第だ: depends on; is decided by; changes depending on.<br/><br/>Ｎ + 次第だ・次第で(は)",
      "credits_raw": "rubyhatchet",
      "content_sha256": "29d06001b135686cda8b39ab82d9b897ca3dfc511d60c52e3a97cef69dbfade9",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 1,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "This is a conjuction/noun which is used to express that an action indicated by a preceding verb or an action implemented by a preceding noun is a prerequisite for another action.\n\nインドに着き次第を電話差し上げます。\nAs soon as I get to india, I will call you.",
      "html": "This is a conjuction/noun which is used to express that an action indicated by a preceding verb or an action implemented by a preceding noun is a prerequisite for another action.<br/><br/>インドに着き次第を電話差し上げます。<br/>As soon as I get to india, I will call you.",
      "credits_raw": "brij_shukla2000",
      "content_sha256": "54abfd67b4f3bd05fa0a36c00b30e70748d363156b2319ec261e61ba87e69ea7",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Sorry, I inadvertently deleted an example on this page. Can somebody put it back?",
      "html": "Sorry, I inadvertently deleted an example on this page. Can somebody put it back?",
