    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "I'm not an expert, but does the example given above reflect the definition \"as soon as\"?",
      "html": "I'm not an expert, but does the example given above reflect the definition \"as soon as\"?",
      "credits_raw": "Leslie",
      "content_sha256": "6426b34c480ea86c5202f3f06d5106393cf77c8394cab4246e44438436ba301f",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 5,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "thanks leslie - that was a mixup.\n〜次第　 = as soon\n〜次第で = depending on...\n\nso I added a see also to [shidaide] and a better example",
      "html": "thanks leslie - that was a mixup.<br/>〜次第　 = as soon<br/>〜次第で = depending on...<br/><br/>so I added a see also to [shidaide] and a better example",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "2acaa00562b003a2ddd508e3dec045d9b9c7b43a40563421eedf0ab2225624fa",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 6,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Yea, the example given above does reflect \"as soon as\" too, depending upon what follows. E.G., その結果を聞き次第、ご連絡します would be \"I will contact you as soon as I hear the result.\"",
      "html": "Yea, the example given above does reflect \"as soon as\" too, depending upon what follows. E.G., その結果を聞き次第、ご連絡します would be \"I will contact you as soon as I hear the result.\"",
      "credits_raw": "bamboo4",
      "content_sha256": "97e8e93faa1fe0e2ffb3a884a7886bae417d23fa1c7d5c8328b33248fc193c12",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 7,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "「〜次第」「〜次第で」で分けるのではなくて、\"Verb(stem)+次第=as soon as\"、\"Noun＋次第/次第で=depending on\"と、その前に来る品詞で分けてはどうでしょうか。",
      "html": "「〜次第」「〜次第で」で分けるのではなくて、\"Verb(stem)+次第=as soon as\"、\"Noun＋次第/次第で=depending on\"と、その前に来る品詞で分けてはどうでしょうか。",
      "credits_raw": "f.m.",
      "content_sha256": "45e9fedca3e946b718ca20334353e4fd9e67f5cbd49b8b345586efa03d3ebc6d",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 8,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "事と次第によっては許さないよ。 \n\n According to the facts and circumstances I cannot forgive you.",
      "html": "事と次第によっては許さないよ。 <br/><br/> According to the facts and circumstances I cannot forgive you.",
